{"synopsis":"Yeon Hojeong orang pertama yang menyatukan Faksi Dark sebagai pemimpin fraksi Unortodoks bekerja sama dengan Fraksi Ortodoks untuk melewati kekacauan Tiga Kultus Namun dia mati lebih cepat dari yang seharusnya karena terjebak rencana busuk Pemimpin Aliansi Murim\nIni benarbenar rumahku\nKetika dia membuka matanya dia berada di Klan Yeon yang seharusnya sudah runtuh tempat yang tidak mungkin pernah ia lupakan\nAku tidak akan membuat kesalahan kali ini tidak lagi\nKetetapan untuk mencegah keruntuhan keluarganya dan masa depan yang bergejolak garagara Tiga Kultus dia memulai perjalanan tiada akhir Ini adalah perjuangan Yeon Hojeong putra tertua untuk menyatukan dunia murim","alternative_title":"흑백무제. Martial Emperor of the Unortodoks and Ortodoks","author":"Baek Joon, Hyeon Lim","artist":"VICTOR","chapters":[{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"c836e728-a83c-4a5f-a822-50a3fcd584b9","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-07-31"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"f7831625-8b12-4e34-9fa7-b4dae3e50f22","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-07-26"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"1a279945-3855-4b3d-b29e-7ac26c277105","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-07-17"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"0d1854ab-be16-4648-ba46-0b3b84e78c72","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-07-12"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"b688fb36-0a5b-403c-bbf6-37667c2a7b34","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-07-03"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"e848231f-7359-4d2b-b997-dfa33fcd5b5d","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-06-26"},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"cc57ba35-9349-44bd-8349-6c61da0d71ba","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-06-19"},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"1b05ac9e-bc7e-4961-b644-560325ccf10f","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-06-19"},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"31665cf0-a269-49e6-8b1c-7efb0dda7643","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2024-11-26"},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"89f5055a-27df-4bb0-b0fc-744ed8e1989d","title":"Chapter 52","date":"202